<div class="container">
    <header>
        <h1>Privacy Policy — AdGang</h1>
        <time datetime="2025-10-01">Effective Date: October 2025</time>
    </header>

    <p>AdGang respects your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal data. This policy explains what information we collect and how we use it.</p>

    <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>AdGang does not collect personal data such as name, email, or precise location. The app may process files to perform white or black lists, but this data is processed locally on your device and is <strong>not</strong> transmitted to external servers.</p>

    <h2>2. All is under your control</h2>
    <p>
        The application provides predefined DNS configurations (such as AdGuard servers) to enhance privacy and security. However, the user retains full control over DNS settings, including the ability to modify upstream servers, and to add or remove domains in blocklists or whitelists.
        By using the application, the user acknowledges and agrees that all custom DNS configurations and filtering decisions are made at their own discretion and risk. The developers are not responsible for any network interruptions, accessibility issues, or filtering outcomes resulting from the user’s modifications or DNS choices.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Subscription Information</h2>
    <p>If you purchase a subscription, your payment information is handled securely by Apple through the App Store. AdGang does not have access to your payment details, billing information, or Apple account credentials.</p>

    <h2>4. Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>AdGang does not share your data with third parties. The app does not use analytics or advertising SDKs that collect personal data.</p>

    <h2>5. Contact Us</h2>
    <p>If you have questions about this policy, please contact us at <a href="mailto:siteartstudio@@gmail.com">siteartstudio@@gmail.com</a>.</p>

    <footer>
        <p>This Privacy Policy may be updated from time to time. We will post any changes on this page with an updated effective date.</p>
    </footer>
</div>
